1 DUNMER~
The Dunmer, more commonly referred to as Dark Elves in the rest of Tamriel, are
the dark skinned elves originating from the province of Morrowind.

Attributes:
Willpower -2, Intelligence +2, Endurance +1, Personality -1.

Characteristics:
> Fire resistance.
> Ancestor guardian (see the spell).~
1 ORC~
The Orsimer, commonly known as Orcs, are considered to be barbarians by most of
the other races on Nirn and they are from the mountainous regions of western
Tamriel.

Attributes:
Strength +1, Agility -2, Willpower +1, Intelligence -1, Endurance +3, Personality -2.

Characteristics:
> Magic resistance.
> Orcish berserk (see the spell).
~
1 BOSMER~
The Bosmer are the Elven folk of Valenwood, a forested province in Tamriel. In
the Empire, they are often referred to as Wood Elves.

Attributes:
Strength -1, Agility +4, Willpower -2, Endurance -1.

Characteristics:
> Disease resistance.
> Beast tongue (see the spell)..
~
1 LYCANTHROPY~
Lycanthropy (also known as Sanies Lupinus) is a disease that causes the victim
to transform into a were-creature and is generally contracted by being bitten
by a pre-existing one.

Lycanthropes cannot be vampires.

Positives:
Strength +2, Agility +2, Endurance +2.
Immunity to Paralysis and Disease.
Armor class -50.

Negatives:
Weakness to poison damage.
Extra damage from silver weapons (1-30 hps).

~
1 VAMPIRISM~
Vampirism is a disease that can be contracted during melee combat with anyone
who is infected. It may also be obtained from searching corpses.. After three
days the victim's body is overwhelmed and must live as a vampire.

Vampires cannot be lycanthropes.

Positives:
Strength +2, Agility +2, Willpower +2.
Immunity to Paralysis and Disease.
Armor class -50.

Negatives:
Weakness to fire damage.
Sun damage outdoors in daytime 30 hps per hour.
~
1 FLIRT~
This skill will allow you to flirt with npcs of the opposite sex. If successful
your confidence will be boosted gainning advantages for a period.

If successful: +1 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +1 Intelligence.
Chance to succeed: Skill % /2 + personality.
Cost: 10.~
1 ALTMER~
Altmer are the light-skinned, tall Elves of the Summerset Isles. They consider
themselves the perfect race.

Attributes:
Strength -2, Intelligence +3, Endurance -1.

Characteristics:
> Disease weakness.
> Shock weakness.
> Fire weakness.
> Magic resistance.
> Starts with 200 magicka.~
1 IMPERIAL~
Also known as Cyrodiils, the well-educated and well-spoken Imperials are the
natives of the civilized, cosmopolitan province of Cyrodiil.

Attributes:
Agility -2, Willpower -1, Personality +3.

Characteristics:
> Star of the west (see the spell).
> Voice of the emperor (see the spell).

~
1 BRETON~
Bretons are the human descendants of the Aldmeri-Nedic Manmer of the Merethic
Era and are now the inhabitants of the province of High Rock.

Attributes:
Strength -1, Agility -2, Willpower +3, Intelligence +2, Endurance -2.

Characteristics:
> Dragon skin (see the spell).
> Magic resistance.
> Starts with 150 magicka.
~
1 NORD~
The Nords are the children of the sky, a race of tall and fair-haired humans
from Skyrim.

Attributes:
Strength +3, Agility -1, Willpower +1, Intelligence -2, Endurance +1, Personality -2.

Characteristics:
> Thunder fist (see the spell).
> Woad (see the spell).
> Shock resistance.
> Frost immunity.~
1 REDGUARD~
Redguards believed to be the most naturally talented warriors in Tamriel. The
dark-skinned, wiry-haired people of Hammerfell seem born to battle.

Attributes:
Strength +2, Willpower -2, Intelligence -2, Endurance +3, Personality +1.

Characteristics:
> Adrenaline rush (see the spell).
> Poison resistance.
> Disease resistance.~
1 KHAJIIT~
The Khajiit of Elsweyr can vary in appearance from nearly elven to the Cathay-
Raht "jaguar men" to the great Senche-Tiger. The most common breed found in
Morrowind, the Suthay-raht, is intelligent, quick, and agile.

Attributes:
Strength -1, Agility +3, Willpower -2.

Characteristics:
> Detect hidden constantly.
> Eye of fear (see the spell).~
1 ARGONIAN~
Argonians are the reptilian natives of Black Marsh. In years of defending their
borders have made the Argonians experts in guerrilla warfare, and their natural
abilities make them equally at home in water and on land.

Attributes:
Agility +3, Willpower -1, Intelligence +2, Endurance -2, Personality -2.

Characteristics:
> Affected from water breathing constantly.
> Immunity to poison.
> Disease resistance.~
