1 IMBUE~
Imbue skill will allow you to imbue elemental magic damage to weapons.
You will need a runestone to do this.

Check to succeed: Skill % /2 + intelligence.
Cost: 10.
~
1 INNERVATE~
This automatic skill will allow you to gain magicka in battle exchanging it
with fatigue.

Check to succeed: Skill % /10 + willpower.
Cost: 10.
Magicka gain: 10
~
1 UNARMORED~
The unarmored proficiency is used to move and defend while wearing clothing
items like shirt, pants, robes etc.

Actions: None

Skills: Unarmored

As higher you train these armor skills, the more armor you will receive from
wearing armor of this category.

About skill:
The unarmored skill will give you extra armor when wearing clothing instead of
armor. The higher quality is the clothing item you wear, the more bonus armor
you will receive.
~
1 POUNCE~
This automatic action will damage target's health.

Check to succeed: Skill % /10 + strength.
Effect: 1d10 + luck.
Cost: 10 + effect /2.
~
